# Both apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/mobile-web/Dockerfile build from the repo root and run
# their own `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` inside the image — the host's own
# node_modules/dist/coverage are never copied in. Copying them would risk shipping
# host-platform-compiled native binaries (@swc/core, esbuild, Prisma's query engine) built
# for whatever platform ran `pnpm install` outside Docker, silently mismatched against the
# container's own linux/glibc target.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.expo
.git

# Real secrets never belong in an image layer — env vars are injected by
# docker-compose.prod.yml's `environment:` at container start, not read from a baked-in
# file. Mirrors .gitignore's own .env exception shape.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
